WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:17.646
Every time Bada answered the phone, he remembered what Mom had told him to say.

2
00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:21.309
Bada: Hello. This is the Kangs' residence.

3
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.258
Mrs. Kim: Hi, Bada. Is Mom home?

4
00:00:24.259 --> 00:00:28.242
Bada: Who is calling please?

5
00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:30.766
Mrs. Kim: Oh, this is Mrs. Kim.

6
00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:34.312
Bada: Hi, Mrs. Kim. I will get her for you.

7
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:40.789
Mom! Mom! Where are you?

8
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.703
Mom: I am in the bathroom, Bada.

9
00:00:43.704 --> 00:00:46.309
Bada: Mrs. Kim is on the phone.

10
00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:51.268
Mom: Tell her that I will call right back.

11
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:55.592
Bada: Okay. Hello, Mrs. Kim?

12
00:00:55.593 --> 00:00:57.544
Mom is in the bathroom.

13
00:00:57.545 --> 00:00:59.903
Bada: She said she will call you back.

14
00:00:59.904 --> 00:01:02.541
Mrs. Kim: Very well. Thank you, Bada.

15
00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:07.179
Bada: You're welcome, Mrs. Kim. Bye.

16
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.639
Everyone says that Bada has such wonderful phone manners.

17
00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:18.471
Even I am surprised!
